'''Korfax, Champion of the Light''' is a [[human]] [[quest giver]] located at [[Light's Hope Chapel]] in the [[Eastern Plaguelands]]. A member of the [[Brotherhood of the Light]], a subsection of the [[Argent Dawn]]'s ranks, he offers quests to adventurers to collect [[Dark Iron Scraps]] to then exchange them with him for an [[Insignia of the Dawn]].<ref>{{questlong|Neutral|60|Dark Iron Scraps (quest)|Dark Iron Scraps}}</ref>

He also tells the story of [[Ramaladni]], a warrior of the Brotherhood and a pupil of Highlord [[Alexandros Mograine]], who went to [[Naxxramas]] in search of revenge and never returned, asking the adventurers to find out his fate.<ref>{{questlong|Neutral|60R|The Fate of Ramaladni}}</ref> When they returned only with his ring, Korfax announced that this did not bode well for Ramaladni, but that his ring might be salvageable, leading to the creation of [[Ramaladni's Icy Grasp]].<ref>{{questlong|Neutral|60|Ramaladni's Icy Grasp (quest)|Ramaladni's Icy Grasp}}</ref>

Finally, he aided warrior adventurers in the creation of the [[Dreadnaught's Battlegear]], asking them to bring back to him the desecrated battlements and wartorn plate scraps they would come across in their battles with the Scourge, in [[Naxxramas]], to forge them an armor worn by heroes.<ref>{{questlong|Neutral|60R|Dreadnaught Breastplate (quest)|Dreadnaught Breastplate|class=warrior}}</ref>

During the [[Third War]], Korfax fought alongside [[Alexandros Mograine]]  prior to the Scarlet Highlord's death and the forming of the Argent Dawn, watching the Highlord open the fetid skulls of the living dead with his boots.<ref>{{questlong|Neutral|60R|Dreadnaught Sabatons (quest)|Dreadnaught Sabatons|class=warrior}}</ref>

