'''Klaven's Tower''', named after its rogue [[Defias]] master [[Klaven Mortwake]], lies at the southeastern edge of [[Westfall]] near the river and north of the [[Dagger Hills]]. [[SI:7]] has been scouting this tower for some time and sometimes seeks help from adventurous rogues to sneak in and gather intelligence. It is a well known launching point for [[Defias]] activity such that it has also been called the "Defias Tower". Klaven's Tower is used, along with [[Jerod's Landing]] in [[Elwynn Forest]], in the smuggling of stolen goods from [[Redridge]].<ref>{{questlong|Alliance|20|Mathias and the Defias|class=rogue}}</ref>

